      <activity id="3fe00b7f-87d7-58f3-af82-3555505e5f93" activityNameId="241d4e38-7571-5ae9-956f-8747c5b93937" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Asphalt concrete (AC) 22 EME C2, 50% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Asphalt concrete (AC) 22 EME C2, 50% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: c07eec46-218f-4020-9717-c0e8e80aad52
This dataset covers the production of Asphalt Concrete AC 22 EME C2 in Switzerland, with 50% reclaimed asphalt. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix asphalt concrete AC 22 EME C2, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c07eec46-218f-4020-9717-c0e8e80aad52.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
